text.section:
A business trust restating its articles of trust shall file with the Commission articles of restatement setting forth:

The name of the business trust immediately prior to restatement;


Whether the restatement contains an amendment to the articles of trust;


The text of the restated articles of trust or amended and restated articles of trust;


The date of adoption of the articles of restatement; and


A statement that the restatement was adopted in accordance with the articles of trust and the governing instrument of the business trust.
